#, php-format
msgid ""
"Materialization of %d Filter(s) was started in the background.  %d Filter(s)"
" are already being materialized.  Its results are reported in the Cacti log."
msgstr ""
"Materialisering av %d filter startades i bakgrunden.  %d filter håller redan"
" på att materialiseras.  Resultaten rapporteras i Cacti-loggen."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Materialization of %d Filter(s) was started in the background.  Its results "
"are reported in the Cacti log."
msgstr ""
"Materialisering av %d filter startades i bakgrunden.  Resultaten rapporteras"
" i Cacti-loggen."

msgid ""
"The selected Filter(s) are already being materialized.  Please try again "
"once that has finished."
msgstr ""
"De valda filtren håller redan på att materialiseras.  Försök igen när det är"
" klart."

msgid ""
"Click 'Continue' to Materialize the following Filter(s) in the background, "
"with NAT on and off, for the entire range of flow data.  Partitions that are"
" already materialized and accurate are skipped.  This can take a long time "
"on large data sets.  A Filter that is already being materialized is skipped."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ”Fortsätt” för att materialisera följande filter i bakgrunden, med"
" och utan NAT, för hela intervallet med flödesdata.  Partitioner som redan "
"är materialiserade och aktuella hoppas över.  Det kan ta lång tid för stora "
"datamängder.  Filter som redan håller på att materialiseras hoppas över."

msgid "Prune"
msgstr "Rensa"

msgid "Remove the cached shards that do not match any Filter"
msgstr "Ta bort de cachade fragment som inte matchar något filter"

msgid "Materialization"
msgstr "Materialisering"

msgid "NAT Shards"
msgstr "NAT-fragment"

msgid ""
"The number of partitions of this Filter that are stored in the Parallel "
"Query cache with NAT on."
msgstr ""
"Antalet partitioner för detta filter som lagras i cachen för parallella "
"frågor med NAT aktiverat."

msgid "Non-NAT Shards"
msgstr "Fragment utan NAT"

msgid ""
"The number of partitions of this Filter that are stored in the Parallel "
"Query cache with NAT off."
msgstr ""
"Antalet partitioner för detta filter som lagras i cachen för parallella "
"frågor med NAT inaktiverat."

msgid "Partitions"
msgstr "Partitioner"

msgid ""
"The total number of flow partitions, which is the most shards a Filter can "
"have cached with or without NAT."
msgstr ""
"Det totala antalet flödespartitioner, vilket är det högsta antal fragment "
"ett filter kan ha i cachen med eller utan NAT."

msgid ""
"The cached shards of the Filters could not be told apart from the others, as"
" the cache keys of a Filter could not be worked out."
msgstr ""
"Filtrens cachade fragment kunde inte skiljas från de andra eftersom "
"cachenycklarna för ett filter inte kunde beräknas."

msgid ""
"The cache keys of the Filters could not be worked out, so nothing can be "
"pruned right now.  Check that each Filter has a valid Report."
msgstr ""
"Filtrens cachenycklar kunde inte beräknas, så inget kan rensas just nu.  "
"Kontrollera att varje filter har en giltig rapport."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"Cached Shards: %s matching a Filter.  %s not matching any Filter, which "
"Prune removes."
msgstr ""
"Cachade fragment: %s matchar ett filter.  %s matchar inget filter och tas "
"bort vid rensning."

#, php-format
msgid ""
"This removes %s cached shard(s) that do not match any Filter, for every "
"Filter and every user.  They come from Filters that were changed or deleted,"
" and from reports with settings changed on the report page.  The %s cached "
"shard(s) of the Filters are kept.  This can not be undone."
msgstr ""
"Detta tar bort %s cachade fragment som inte matchar något filter, för alla "
"filter och användare.  De kommer från filter som har ändrats eller tagits "
"bort och från rapporter vars inställningar har ändrats på rapportsidan.  "
"Filtrens %s cachade fragment behålls.  Detta kan inte ångras."

msgid "Every cached shard matches a Filter.  There is nothing to prune."
msgstr "Alla cachade fragment matchar ett filter.  Det finns inget att rensa."

msgid "Prune Cached Shards"
msgstr "Rensa cachade fragment"
